to determine KPI score and status.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="227651">target</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2163555">ເປົ້າ​ໝາຍ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10089_227652_2163555"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">As one aspect of a KPI, the desired level of performance with respect to a specific business goal or strategy. Actual values are evaluated against the target to determine KPI score and status.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="227652">target value</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2163555">ເປົ້າ​ໝາຍ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10094_157455_465858"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An interactive tool that makes it easier to set up commonly used accessibility features by specifying options by type of disability, rather than by numeric value changes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="157455">Accessibility Wizard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="465858">ຕົວຊວ່ຍສ້າງການເຂົ້າຫາ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfS