t it can be retrieved later by the same security support component, and only by that security support component.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="338545">seal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2179644">ປິດໄວ້</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10916_338545_466659"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To store data in such a way that it can be retrieved later by the same security support component, and only by that security support component.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="338545">seal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="466659">ກາຈໍ້າ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10918_20790_2849051"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To measure the performance of something according to specified standards in order to improve it.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="20790">benchmark</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2849051">ວັດແທກປຽບທຽບ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10928_359996_466752"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A table, query, form, report, macro, or module that remains in the replica or Design Master where it was created. Neither the object nor changes to the object are copied to other members in the replica set.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="359996">local object</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="466752">ຮູບແບບປະເພນີດັ້ງເດີມ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10934_237291_2162591"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An option that applies a read-only state to a document inside client applications.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="237291">Mark as Final</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2162591">ໝາຍວ່າສຸດທ້າຍແລ້ວ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10935_54757_2357705"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To associate a flag with a message or other item.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="54757">flag</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2357705">ໝາຍໄວ້</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10945_139125_2301725"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A software program that reduces a file's size for storage on a disk. If a compressed file is too large to fit onto a single disk, the compression utility copies it onto multiple disks.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="139125">compression utility</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2301725">ຢູທິລິຕີ້ບີບອັດຂໍ້ມູນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10947_320488_465292"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Erroneous or unrecognizable because of a flaw in reasoning or an error in input. Invalid results, for example, might occur if the logic in a program is faulty.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="320488">not valid</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="465292">ໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10947_70460_465292"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Erroneous or unrecognizable because of a flaw in reasoning or an error in input. Invalid results, for example, might occur if the logic in a program is faulty.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="70460">invalid</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="465292">ໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10963_306412_466388"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A menu item in Internet Explorer that turns on the tool for Tablet PC users that allows the user to move the content of the page up and down, like a mouse scroll wheel.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="306412">Panning Hand</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="466388">ມືຈັບເລື່ອນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="10964_169207_465889"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To reverse changes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="169207">roll back</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="465889">ໝູນກັບ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech"