ingular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2720405">ຕົວບັນທຶກກະແຈ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12106_65506_465266"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To displace the left or right edge of a text item, such as a block or a line, relative to the margin or to another text item.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="65506">indent</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="465266">ຫຍໍ້ໜ້າ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12108_140776_2301813"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">For automatic subtotals and worksheet outlines, the subtotal rows or columns that are totaled by summary data. Detail data is typically adjacent to and either above or to the left of the summary data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="140776">detail data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2301813">ຂໍ້ມູນລາຍລະອຽດ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12125_2524826_2302060"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An operation that retrieves rows from multiple source tables by comparing the values from columns shared between the source tables. An inner join excludes rows from a source table that have no matching rows in the other source tables.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2524826">inner</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302060">ການຮວມພາຍໃນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12125_67181_2302060"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An operation that retrieves rows from multiple source tables by comparing the values from columns shared between the source tables. An inner join excludes rows from a source table that have no matching rows in the other source tables.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="67181">inner join</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302060">ການຮວມພາຍໃນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12133_460782_2163497"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An Office feature that allows users to create professional looking information graphics quickly and easily.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="460782">SmartArt</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2163497">ສິ​ລະ​ປະ​ອັດ​ສະ​ລິ​ຍະ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12133_545625_2163497"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An Office feature that allows users to create professional looking information graphics quickly and easily.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="545625">SmartArt graphics</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2163497">ສິ​ລະ​ປະ​ອັດ​ສະ​ລິ​ຍະ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12141_56316_2301990"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Two arrows in shape of a cross, with two heads each pointing in opposite directions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="56316">four-headed arrow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2301990">ລູກສອນສີ່ຫົວ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12144_237193_2301679"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To place a file or project back in a source repository. This releases the