nail picture</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302677">ຮູບພາບໂຕຢ່າງ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12284_524826_465612"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A miniature version of an image that is often used for quick browsing through multiple images.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="524826">thumbnail picture</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="465612">ຮູບຂະໜາດຫຍໍ້</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12304_232821_2301950"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A dictionary with words that the main dictionary recognizes as being spelled correctly, but that you want to verify during a spelling check.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="232821">exclude dictionary</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2301950">ວັດຈະນານຸກົມແຍກຄຳສັບ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="12310_182655_465925"