es an open, lightweight environment but more importantly enables users to focus on their content rather than the interface.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="777773">Windows Aero</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="466110">ອາອີໂຣ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15359_777773_466111"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The visual experience of the premium Windows Vista editions. Windows Aero builds on the Basic and Standard user experiences to offer customers our best-designed, highest-performing desktop environment. A noticeable element of the new Windows Aero experience is the professional-looking, transparent glass design, which creates an open, lightweight environment but more importantly enables users to focus on their content rather than the interface.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="777773">Windows Aero</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="466111">ລະຫັດຂອງວິນໂດວິສຕາ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15369_71392_465296"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A specified amount of processing performed as a unit by a computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="71392">job</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="465296">ວຽກເຮັດ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15381_431811_2776158"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The use of audio, video, or computer equipment linked through a communications system to enable geographically separated individuals to participate in a meeting or discussion.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="431811">teleconferencing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2776158">ການໂທປະຊຸມທາງໄກ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15382_232822_2301951"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An option that switches the view from the display of HTML source code to the display of Web page content.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="232822">Exit HTML Source</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2301951">ອອກຈາກ HTML Source</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15383_2482719_2487473"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The primary circuit board in a computer that contains most of the basic components of the system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2482719">baseboard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2487473">ແຜ່ນວົງຈອນພື້ນຖານ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15383_81653_2487473"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The primary circuit board in a computer that contains most of the basic components of the system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="81653">motherboard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2487473">ແຜ່ນວົງຈອນພື້ນຖານ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15383_81654_2487473"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The primary circuit board in a computer that contains most of the basic components of the system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="81654">system board</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2487473">ແຜ່ນວົງຈອນພື້ນຖານ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15384_178508_2344015"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An order for a large quantity of products or services. The minimum quantity that qualifies as a bulk order is set by individual companies.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="178508">bulk order</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2344015">ການສັ່ງຊື້ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15386_154964_2179621"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A delay of the amount of time that elapses before a character begins repeating when you hold down a key.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="154964">repeat delay</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2179621">ຄວາມຊັກຊ້າຂອງການຊໍ້າຄືນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15386_154964_465843"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A delay of the amount of time that elapses before a character begins repeating when you hold down a key.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="154964">repeat delay</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="465843">ລື້ມຄືນຊ້າໆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15396_148352_2302558"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">E-mail accounts and folders that you can group and set common options for, such as whether to download headers or messages, size limits on downloaded messages, behavior online vs. offline, and time interval for connecting to the server.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="148352">Send/Receive group</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302558">ກຸ່ມ ສົ່ງ/ຮັບ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="154_543576_2163475"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A member of the Administrators group on the local server computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="543576">server administrator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2163475">ຜູ້​ຄວາມ​ຄຸມ​ເຊີບ​ເວີ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1542_30264_2179215"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A symbol that carries meaning in language, such as a letter, number, punctuation mark, or emoticon.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="30264">character</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2179215">ຕົວອັກສອນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15424_65290_465265"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Unable to be used together.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="65290">incompatible</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="465265">ເຂົ້າກັນບໍ່ໄດ້</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15430_91737_465456"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The % character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="91737">percent sign</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="465456">ເຄື່ອງໝາຍເປີເຊັນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15438_137719_2301633"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Any graphics on a slide, including drawing objects, patterns in a background fill, and pictures.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="137719">background graphics</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2301633">ຮູບພາບພື້ນຫຼັງ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15449_261564_466190"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A tool used to edit the content of web pages that the customer has created with Office Live.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="261564">Page Editor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="466190">ເຄຶ່ອງມືດັດແກ້ໜ້າເວັບ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15452_219611_2162523"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of data that is organized and summarized into a multidimensional structure that is defined by a set of dimensions and measures.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="219611">OLAP cube</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2162523">ກ້ອນ OLAP</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15452_219611_465082"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of data that is organized and summarized into a multidimensional structure that is defined by a set of dimensions and measures.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="219611">OLAP cube</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="465082">ຮູບກ້ອນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15452_41272_2162523"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of data that is organized and summarized into a multidimensional structure that is defined by a set of dimensions and measures.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="41272">cube</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2162523">ກ້ອນ OLAP</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15452_41272_465082"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of data that is organized and summarized into a multidimensional structure that is defined by a set of dimensions and measures.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="41272">cube</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="465082">ຮູບກ້ອນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15456_231959_2163044"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A field that's assigned a column orientation in a PivotTable report. Items associated with a column field are displayed as column labels.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="231959">column field</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2163044">ບ່ອນ​ປ້ອນ​ຂໍ້​ມູນ​ຖັນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15457_461710_2599900"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An Excel feature that identifies invalid worksheet data, formulas, or formatting and proposes corrections.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="461710">error checking</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2599900">ການກວດສອບຄວາມຜິດພາດ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15459_303758_2179768"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An upgrade option that allows users to upgrade from one edition of Windows to another by purchasing the upgrade online. It is enabled by Software Licensing Services (SLS) technology which allows a digital lincense to determine what features are enabled or disabled allowing Microsoft to sell either additional licenses or product upgrades through digital licenses (PUP-DL). Customers may either buy full packaged product (FPP) or upgrade quickly and conveniently electronically.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="303758">Windows Anytime Upgrade</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2179768">WAU</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="15459_303758_2179779"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An upgrade option that allows users to upgrade from one edition of Windows to another by purchasing the upgrade online. It is enabled by Software Licensing Services (SLS) technology which allows a digital lincense to determine what features are enabled or disabled allowing Microsoft to sell either additional licenses or product upgrades through digital licenses (PUP-DL). Customers may either buy full packaged product (FPP) or upgrade quickly and conveniently electronically.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="303758">Windows Anytime Upgrade</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2179779">Windows Anytime Upgrade</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote