ins shortcuts to various folders.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508829">Places Bar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2163380">ແຖບ​ສະ​ຖານ​ທີ່</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16175_477172_2163380"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An area at the left side in some dialog boxes, such as Save As, Open, and Insert Picture that contains shortcuts to various folders.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="477172">My Places bar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2163380">ແຖບ​ສະ​ຖານ​ທີ່</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16176_143109_2302013"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A margin setting that adds extra space to the side or top margin of a document you plan to bind. A gutter margin ensures that text isn't obscured by the binding.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="143109">gutter margin</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302013">ຂອບນອກ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16183_1608214_2855689"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The server-based report generation environment for enterprise, Web-enabled reporting functionality that allows users to create reports that draw content from a variety of data sources, publish reports in various formats, and centrally manage security and subscriptions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1608214">Microsoft SQL Server Reporting Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2855689">SSRS</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16183_169566_2855689"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The server-based report generation environment for enterprise, Web-enabled reporting functionality that allows users to create reports that draw content from a variety of data sources, publish reports in various formats, and centrally manage security and subscriptions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="169566">SQL Server Reporting Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2855689">SSRS</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16183_169567_2855689"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The server-based report generation environment for enterprise, Web-enabled reporting functionality that allows users to create reports that draw content from a variety of data sources, publish reports in various formats, and centrally manage security and subscriptions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="169567">SSRS</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2855689">SSRS</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16183_2482816_2855689"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The server-based report generation environment for enterprise, Web-enabled reporting functionality that allows users to create reports that draw content from a variety of data sources, publish reports in various formats, and centrally manage security and subscriptions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2482816">Reporting Services</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2855689">SSRS</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16190_184195_2302581"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Content has been hashed and verified as valid against the signature. The certificate used to verify the signature is “valid” in the sense that it has a relationship to a trusted certificate authority (and isn’t expired, etc.)</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="184195">Signed - verified</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302581">ລາຍເຊັນ - ກວດສອບແລ້ວ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16213_2167436_2191530"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A hard plastic disc on a mouse that is perpendicular to the mouse surface. It is normally located between the left and right mouse buttons and is used for scrolling.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2167436">mouse wheel</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2191530">ຕົວ​ເລື່ອນ​ເມົ້າ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16213_534934_2191530"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A hard plastic disc on a mouse that is perpendicular to the mouse surface. It is normally located between the left and right mouse buttons and is used for scrolling.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="534934">scroll wheel</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2191530">ຕົວ​ເລື່ອນ​ເມົ້າ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="1622_234771_466096"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to Microsoft software which is published by Microsoft, properly licensed, and fully supported by Microsoft or a trusted partner.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="234771">genuine</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="466096">ຂອງແທ້</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16223_237296_466154"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows the user to select from a gallery of pre-defined formatting styles and apply them quickly to tables, text, charts, drawing objects and SmartArt graphics.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="237296">Quick Styles</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="466154">ແບບໄວໆ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16225_232420_2302521"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A secure email feature that lets you add sensitivity labels, such as Internal Use Only, to the message header. Security labels in your organization are controlled by security policies set up by your email administrator.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="232420">security label</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302521">ປ້າຍກຳກັບຄວາມປອດໄພ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16231_1511980_2115059"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A computer (or the software that runs on it) that acts as a barrier between a network and the Internet by presenting only a single network address to external sites.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1511980">network proxy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2115059">ພຣອກຊີ່</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="16231_95688_2115059"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A computer (or the software that runs on it) that acts as a barrier between a network and the Internet by presenting only a single network address to external sites.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="95688">proxy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2115059">ພຣອກຊີ່</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage"