28_2300834"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A statistical type of chart that uses boxes to indicate statistical distribution and easily identify outlier points. There are five values: upper quartile, lower quartile, High Box, Low Box, and Median.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="647128">box plot chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2300834">ແຜນວາດ ບັອກ ແລະ ວິສເກີ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17445_761390_2300834"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A statistical type of chart that uses boxes to indicate statistical distribution and easily identify outlier points. There are five values: upper quartile, lower quartile, High Box, Low Box, and Median.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="761390">boxplot</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2300834">ແຜນວາດ ບັອກ ແລະ ວິສເກີ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="17456_648311_2163607"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that tracks and stores a record of a shared document when it is first created, and each time it is edited.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="648311">version history</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote