 right-to-left or left-to-right language attributes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="651182">neutral character</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302222">ໂຕອັກສອນເປັນກາງ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="18840_651191_2163330"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A file you create on your hard disk or a network share to store OLAP source data for a PivotTable or PivotChart report. Offline cube files allow you to keep working when you are not connected to the OLAP server.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="651191">offline cube file</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2163330">ໄຟ​ລ໌​ກ້ອນອອ​ຟ​ລາຍ​ນ໌</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="18851_651202_2302323"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The result of assigning more tasks to a resource than the resource can accomplish in the working time available.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="651202">overallocation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302323">ການຈັດສັນທີ່ຫຼາຍເກີນໄປ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote 