ered to their inbox, including spam and phishing messages (identified by the mail service) and messages from blocked senders and domains.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="762951">junk e-mail</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149638">ຂີ້​ເຫຍື້ອ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20992_762956_2149495"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An email that a customer does not want delivered to their inbox, including spam and phishing messages (identified by the mail service) and messages from blocked senders and domains.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="762956">junk</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149495">ອີ​ເມວ​ຂີ້​ເຫຍື້ອ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20992_762956_2149638"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An email that a customer does not want delivered to their inbox, including spam and phishing messages (identified by the mail service) and messages from blocked senders and domains.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="762956">junk</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149638">ຂີ້​ເຫຍື້ອ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20993_762953_2149496"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An email filter that enables the user to set the strictness level that keeps junk email from being delivered to their Inbox.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="762953">junk e-mail filter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149496">ຕົວ​ກັ່ນ​ຕອງ​ອີ​ເມວ​ຂີ້​ເຫຍື້ອ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20994_762981_2149639"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The default version that includes drag-and-drop functionality, right-click menus, and a reading pane.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="762981">full version</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149639">ສະ​ບັບ​ເຕັມ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20995_762983_2149459"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The version that uses checkboxes and does not include a reading pane. It is recommneded for users with a slow internet connection.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="762983">classic version</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149459">ລຸ້ນ​ຄ​ລາ​ສິກ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20998_763011_2149640"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of colors and background images that lets users change the appearance of Windows Live pages. The theme is common to all pages, except for group, event, and space pages, which may each have their own theme.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="763011">theme</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149640">ເທມ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="20999_763132_2149641"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To copy something from a computer to a location online, such as a photo album or a blog post.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="763132">publish</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149641">ຕີ​ພິມ​ເຜີຍ​ແຜ່</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21000_763151_2149642"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Parental consent for a child to use a service, view a website, or communicate with a person.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="763151">permission</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149642">ການ​ອະ​ນຸ​ຍາດ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21001_763161_2149509"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A content element a user can add to their space.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="763161">module</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149509">ໂມ​ດູນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21003_763869_2163256"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A SmartArt graphic layout type that includes layouts designed to show nonsequential information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="763869">List</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2163256">​ລາຍ​ການ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21004_763870_2163391"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A SmartArt graphic layout type that includes layouts designed to show steps in a process or timeline.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="763870">Process</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2163391">ຂະ​ບວນ​ການ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21005_763871_2163082"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A SmartArt graphic layout type that includes layouts designed to show a continual process.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="763871">Cycle</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2163082">ວົງ​ມົນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21006_763872_2163212"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A SmartArt graphic layout type that includes layouts designed to show a hierarchical structure, such as an organization chart, or a decision tree.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="763872">Hierarchy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2163212">ລຳ​ດັບ​ຂັ້ນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21007_763873_2163432"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A SmartArt graphic layout type that includes layouts designed to illustrate connections.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="763873">Relationship</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2163432">ຄວາມ​ສຳ​ພັນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21008_763874_2163271"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A SmartArt graphic layout type that includes layouts designed to show how parts relate to a whole.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="763874">Matrix</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2163271">ແມ​ຕ​ຣິກ​</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21009_763875_2163404"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A SmartArt graphic layout type that includes layouts designed to show proportional relationships with the largest component on the top or bottom.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="763875">Pyramid</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2163404">ປີ​ຣາ​ມິດ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21010_763876_2149643"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The overall design of a page or content set, including text elements, controls, and graphics.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="763876">layout</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149643">ແຜນ​ຜັງ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21011_763877_2149644"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A post, comments, and responses made within a conversation space, such as a message board, help board, community, newsgroup, or blog. These exchanges are usually publicly viewable. Participation may require credentials, such as a Windows Live ID.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="763877">discussion</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149644">ການ​ສົນ​ທະ​ນາ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21012_1135481_2149645"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The descriptive information about a user that is shown to other users. This editable information is separate from the registration information they provide to establish their Windows Live account. This separation allows users to disclose or conceal personal information as they choose.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1135481">Windows Live Profile</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149645">ໂປ​ຣ​ໄຟ​ລ໌</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21012_763878_2149645"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The descriptive information about a user that is shown to other users. This editable information is separate from the registration information they provide to establish their Windows Live account. This separation allows users to disclose or conceal personal information as they choose.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="763878">profile</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149645">ໂປ​ຣ​ໄຟ​ລ໌</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21013_763879_2149537"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An answer that only the user knows for a specific question. The answer is used to confirm someone's identity if they forget their password.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="763879">secret answer</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149537">ຄຳ​ຕອບ​ລັບ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21014_763880_2149476"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A security type that helps prevent unauthorized persons from discerning that a user is going to the Windows Live sign-in page. Otherwise, an unauthorized person might be able to intercept and manipulate the code on the sign-in page, which could result in user information being transmitted to an unauthorized website.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="763880">enhanced security</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149476">ຄວາມ​ປອດ​ໄພ​ທີ່​ເພີ່ມ​ແລ້ວ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21015_2392175_2149439"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An email address to which password reset information can be sent if a customer forgets the password portion of their Microsoft account.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2392175">alternate email address</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149439">ທີ່​ຢູ່​ອີ​ເມວ​ສຳ​ຮອງ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21015_2392175_3104000"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An email address to which password reset information can be sent if a customer forgets the password portion of their Microsoft account.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2392175">alternate email address</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3104000">ອີເມວສໍາຮອງ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21015_3103949_2149439"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An email address to which password reset information can be sent if a customer forgets the password portion of their Microsoft account.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3103949">alternate email</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149439">ທີ່​ຢູ່​ອີ​ເມວ​ສຳ​ຮອງ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21015_3103949_3104000"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An email address to which password reset information can be sent if a customer forgets the password portion of their Microsoft account.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3103949">alternate email</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3104000">ອີເມວສໍາຮອງ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21017_763883_2149462"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A function that allows a user to call a computer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="763883">computer call</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149462">ໂທ​ທາງ​ຄອມ​ພິວ​ເຕີ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21018_763884_2149647"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A menu item that enables users to initiate operations, such as sending an instant message or playing a game.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="763884">Actions</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149647">ການ​ກະ​ທຳ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21019_763886_2149560"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A horizontal grouping of actions that apply to the container (or containers) with which the toolbar is associated. For example, a container in which mail is viewed might have an action toolbar with options that include Reply, Delete, and Move to.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="763886">toolbar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149560">ແຖບ​ເຄື່ອງ​ມື</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21022_1216839_2302429"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The user role that is assigned to a user account, which determines the options that are visible to that user and the tasks that the user can perform in the management interface for Exchange Labs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1216839">RBAC role</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302429">ໜ້າທີ່ RBAC</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="21022_1216839_2302475"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descri