tSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22465_1045699_2149575"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The tab on the Family Safety website that displays requests a child has made via email to view a blocked website.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1045699">Website requests</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149575">ການ​ຂໍ​ເວັບ​ໄຊ​ທ໌</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22466_1045700_2149464"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The tab on the Family Safety website that displays requests a child has made via email to have new contacts added.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1045700">Contact requests</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149464">ການ​ຂໍ​ລາຍ​ຊື່​ຕິດ​ຕໍ່</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22470_1045704_2149568"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A method of blocking access to websites based on their content. For example, In Windows Live Family Safety, parents can specify a filtering level, such as Strict or Basic, for their child.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1045704">web filtering</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><t