ring controls that make it easy to narrow down the portion of a data set that's being looked at.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1047907">Slicers</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2163492">ເຄື່ອງ​ແຍກ​ອອກ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22541_1047912_2163507"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A miniature chart that can be inserted into text or embedded within a cell on a worksheet to illustrate highs, lows, and trends in your data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1047912">sparkline</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2163507">ເສັ້ນ​ປະ​ກາຍ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22543_1047914_2302499"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An Outlook Calendar view in which each calendar is listed vertically (not side-by-side). This view is optimized for viewing a schedule for a group and scheduling a meeting for a group.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1047914">Schedule View</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302499">ມຸມມອງກຳນົດການ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</