ic keypad that is part of a device, is displayed on a device, or is in a computer program that you use to enter information in the context of a phone call.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1050744">dial pad</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3188223">ແຜ່ນ​ກົດ​ໂທ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22615_3188175_2258547"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A numeric keypad that is part of a device, is displayed on a device, or is in a computer program that you use to enter information in the context of a phone call.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3188175">dialpad</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2258547">ແຜ່ນ​ກົດ​ໂທ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22615_3188175_3188223"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A numeric keypad that is part of a device, is displayed on a device, or is in a computer program that you use to enter information in the context of a phone call.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3188175">dialpad</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3188223">ແຜ່ນ​ກົດ​ໂທ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22629_1052639_2578450"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The process of creating a hyperlink to a specific page within a Web site or Web-based application instead of to the site’s home page.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1052639">deep linking</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2578450">ການເຊື່ອມໂຍງເລິກ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22631_1052824_2149457"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An icon that is attached to an event and that is viewable in someone's calendar. Depending on the calendar view, a charm may appear next to an event title, or may be the only visual representation of an event on a calendar day.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1052824">charm</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149457">ຄວາມ​ດຶງ​ດູດ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22632_1052846_2302337"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A traditional graphics plotter that uses pens to draw on paper. Pen plotters use one or more colored pens, either fiber-tipped pens or, for highest-quality output, drafting pens.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1052846">pen plotter</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302337">ພລັອດເຕີດ້ວຍບິກ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22646_1053493_2162938"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The part of an email address that identifies a user or an account on an email system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1053493">account name</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2162938">ຊື່​ບັນ​ຊີ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22665_1053565_2302260"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An email message that is sent by a notification activity.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1053565">notification message</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302260">ຂໍ້ຄວາມການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22668_1053572_2302268"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A part of a schema that defines the representation of a resource in ILM "2".</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1053572">object type</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302268">ປະເພດອອບເຈັກ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2268_184296_465936"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A searchable collection of articles and facts about a particular subject area.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="184296">knowledge base</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="465936">ຄວາມຮູ້ພື້ນຖານ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2268_184296_466723"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A searchable collection of articles and facts about a particular subject area.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="184296">knowledge base</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="466723">ເຄບີ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2268_351589_465936"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A searchable collection of articles and facts about a particular subject area.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="351589">KB</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="465936">ຄວາມຮູ້ພື້ນຖານ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2268_351589_466723"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A searchable collection of articles and facts about a particular subject area.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="351589">KB</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="466723">ເຄບີ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2269_2027326_2720408"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A program that appears to be useful or harmless but that contains hidden code designed to exploit or damage the system on which it is run.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2027326">trojan</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2720408">ໂທຣຈັນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2269_2027329_2720408"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A program that appears to be useful or harmless but that contains hidden code designed to exploit or damage the system on which it is run.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2027329">trojan code</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2720408">ໂທຣຈັນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2269_2037686_2720408"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A program that appears to be useful or harmless but that contains hidden code designed to exploit or damage the system on which it is run.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2037686">trojan horse</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2720408">ໂທຣຈັນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22692_1053737_2302331"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A procedure by which a user's password can be changed to a known value, in situations where the user has forgotten or lost their password.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1053737">password reset</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302331">ຕັ້ງລະຫັດຜ່ານໃໝ່</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22734_1054764_2302661"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A view that shows all of the resources on a project and their work over time. This makes it easy to rearrange work, schedule new work, and manage a team's load.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1054764">Team Planner</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302661">Team Planner</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22735_1054767_2302469"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows the application of tags to individual Outlook items to specify retention policy for that message, conversation or other item.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1054767">Retention Policy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302469">ນະໂຍບາຍການເກັບຂໍ້ມູນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22736_1054779_2149451"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">One of a group of photo modifications someone can make to a color photo that mimic different effects that would be achieved by taking the same photo using black and white film stock. One effect uses strict conversion to monochrome by throwing away all of the color information. Others mimic the result when a black and white photo is taken through a colored filter—orange, red, or yellow—to enhance or suppress certain color information. Two effects perform strict conversions to monochrome and then apply a color tint—sepia or cyan—in one step.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1054779">black and white effect</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149451">ເອັບ​ເຝັກ​ຂາວ​ດຳ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22771_1054905_2302755"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A user interface implemented by a software application via a component of a web server, such as IIS.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1054905">web portal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302755">ເວັບທ່າ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22780_1054935_2149500"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The navigational pane at the left of most webpages and Windows folders.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1054935">left pane</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149500">ຖາດ​ເບື້ອງ​ຊ້າຍ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22781_1054938_2149663"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To permit someone else to perform an action.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1054938">allow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149663">ອະ​ນຸ​ຍາດ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2279_26594_464963"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A piece of software that functions as an electronic calendar used for scheduling.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="26594">calendar program</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="464963">ໂປຣແກຣມປະຕິທິນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2279_26594_466326"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A piece of software that functions as an electronic calendar used for scheduling.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="26594">calendar program</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="466326">ປະຕິທິນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2279_294450_464963"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A piece of software that functions as an electronic calendar used for scheduling.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="294450">calendar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="464963">ໂປຣແກຣມປະຕິທິນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2279_294450_466326"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A piece of software that functions as an electronic calendar used for scheduling.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="294450">calendar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="466326">ປະຕິທິນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22823_1055132_2149664"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The navigation button used to return to recently visited Web pages in Internet Explorer, Microsoft Edge, and other internet browsers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1055132">Back</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149664">ກັບ​ຄືນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22826_1055147_2301735"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A staging area that contains representations of selected objects and attributes in a connected data source.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1055147">connector space</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2301735">ພື້ນທີ່ໂຕເຊື່ອມຕໍ່</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22828_1055149_2302174"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The data store that is used by ILM to contain the aggregated identity information from multiple connected data sources, providing a single global, integrated view of all combined objects.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1055149">metaverse</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302174">ເມຕາເວີສ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2285_109836_2302557"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A join in which records from a table are combined with other records from the same table when there are matching values in the joined fields. A self-join can be an inner join or an outer join. In database diagrams, a self-join is called a reflexive relationship.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="109836">self-join</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302557">ການຮວມໂຕເອງ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22858_1815483_2284113"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The email address that forms the user name in a Microsoft account.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1815483">Microsoft account email address</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2284113">ທີ່ຢູ່ອີເມວບັນຊີ Microsoft</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22865_1055946_2163095"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Information that describes the current location of a computer. The location is entered manually in Default Location, and can be used by programs to determine the location of a computer when a location sensor is unavailable.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1055946">default location</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2163095">ຈຸດ​ທີ່​ຕັ້ງ​ມາດ​ຕະ​ຖານ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22886_1056046_2302648"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A software system that retrieves information from a source data store and synchronizes (pushes) to a target data store. Examples of synchronization engines are the ILM 2007 and FIM 2010 synchronization engines, and the service that synchronizes data rows in the SQL Server Express database with objects in the Microsoft Office Outlook data store.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1056046">synchronization engine</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302648">ລະບົບການຊິ້ງຂໍ້ມູນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22886_1056047_2302648"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A software system that retrieves information from a source data store and synchronizes (pushes) to a target data store. Examples of synchronization engines are the ILM 2007 and FIM 2010 synchronization engines, and the service that synchronizes data rows in the SQL Server Express database with objects in the Microsoft Office Outlook data store.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1056047">SyncEngine</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302648">ລະບົບການຊິ້ງຂໍ້ມູນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22889_1056052_2302445"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To refuse to accept a file or message.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1056052">reject</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302445">ປະຕິເສດ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2290_103825_465516"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Generally, any part of a computer system or network, such as a disk drive, printer, or memory, that can be allotted to a running program or a process.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="103825">resource</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="465516">ແຫຼ່ງ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22904_1056071_2301690"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of components and services that enable users to access their Exchange mailboxes through the Outlook Web Access application.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1056071">Client Access server</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2301690">ເຊີບເວີການເຂົ້າເຖິງໄຄລເອນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2291_184207_2302654"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The hierarchical HTML tag structure of an opened HTML document that appears in a task pane window.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="184207">tag tree</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302654">ແຜນຜັງແທັກ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="22919_1056243_2301571"><langSet xml: