 brief note on someone else's profile.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1088661">Post a note</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149526">ໂພ​ສ​ທ໌​ບັນ​ທຶກ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23598_1088662_2149671"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A tag used to identify a person in a photo.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1088662">people tag</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149671">ແທັກ​ຜູ້​ຄົນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23599_1088663_2149672"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The heading for the tags that identify people in a photo. This heading is used for the group of all people tags used in someone's photo gallery, and for the group of people tags in an individual photo.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1088663">People tags</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149672">ແທັກ​ຜູ້​ຄົນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termN