d</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149678">ເພີ່ມ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23876_1091339_2149679"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To adjust the action or aspects of a group of items, typically done more than once.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091339">manage</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149679">ຈັດ​ການ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23877_1091340_2149680"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A text box in which someone types words to begin a search.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091340">search box</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149680">ກ່ອງ​ຊອກ​ຫາ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="2388_415516_2163417"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A name assigned to a cell or group of cells.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="415516">range name</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2163417">ຊື່​ຂອບ​ເຂດ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="239_252121_2163258"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A combination of list formatting options identified by a style name.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="252121">list style</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2163258">ຮູບ​ແບບ​ລາຍ​ການ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23914_1091963_2149485"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A small, star-shaped insignia that indicates new or changed content, as when a contact has posted new photos. It is also can be used to indicate conditions that may require action, as when someone's online storage is running out.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1091963">gleam</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149485">ແສງວູບ​ວາບ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="23915_1091980_2149681"><langSet xml:lang="e