<descrip type="definition">A two-dimensional table that presents data from an external data source.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1506818">query table</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2163408">ຕາ​ຕະ​ລາງ​ການ​ຊັກ​ຖາມ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29233_1506822_2163428"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A system for specifying cells or ranges of cells and that is used in formulas. A reference style is used to specify a specific cell in a two-dimensional table by identifying the row and column that contain that cell or range of cells.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1506822">reference style</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2163428">ຮູບ​ແບບ​ການ​ອ້າງ​ອີງ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29256_1506853_2308201"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A container for items that have been deleted from a first-stage Recycle Bin. Items in a second-stage Recycle Bin are visible only to site collection administrators.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1506853">second-stage Recycle Bin</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="l