tSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29408_1507601_2162930"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A chart that represents data on two axes, x and y, and displays chart objects in flat graphical formatting.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507601">2-D chart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2162930">ແຜນ​ຜັງ 2-D</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29420_1507690_2301676"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Microsoft Office Web Component that provides interactive charting functionality on a Web page. You can illustrate data in a chart and give users the ability to change data, change chart options, and see changes reflected in the chart.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1507690">Chart Component</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2301676">ອົງປະກອບແຜນວາດ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29429_1508178_2302624"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A character that is part of the set that makes up a particular language, such as vowels and consonants.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508178">strong character</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302624">strong character</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29439_1508552_2302492"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An application that parses code and markup in a page to help ensure that only trusted code and markup is run on a computer, server farm, or server cluster.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508552">safe mode parser</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302492">ໂຕວິເຄາະ safe mode</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29440_1508555_2302684"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The area of the Help window that contains a Help topic.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508555">topic pane</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302684">ແຖບຫົວຂໍ້</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29442_1508557_2302494"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A list that identifies which assemblies and types are allowed to run on Web Parts pages in a server farm. The list is stored in the web.config file for the server farm.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508557">SafeControl list</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302494">ລາຍຊື່ SafeControl</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29455_1508759_2301657"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A measure whose value is calculated at run time by using an expression.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508759">calculated measure</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2301657">ການວັດແທກທີ່ຄິດໄລ່ແລ້ວ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="29459_1508807_2302087"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The folder in which various translated files are stored. Each language has a different subfolder that corresponds to its locale identification number (LCID). For example, in a U.S. English installation, the LCID is 1033.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1508807">language folder</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302087">ໂຟນເດີພາສາ</term><termNote type="g