essing or query processing pipeline that contains operators that determine how the content or the query is processed.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653514">flow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2163168">ໄຫຼ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32337_1653516_2302051"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A copy of a search index within an index partition.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653516">index replica</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302051">ແບບຈຳລອງສາລະບານ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32338_1653517_2163335"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An object that processes and enhances items in a content processing flow and processes and enhances queries in a query processing flow.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653517">operator</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2163335">ຕົວ​ຄວບ​ຄຸມ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32339_1653518_2302428"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An XML document that describes how to rank items in search results.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653518">ranking model</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302428">ຮູບແບບການຈັດລຳດັບ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32340_1653519_2302555"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A process that ensures that index replicas on the same index partition remain synchronized during regular operation and during recovery.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653519">seeding</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302555">ຊີດດິງ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32341_1653521_2302721"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A collection of managed properties that are updated together in the search index.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653521">update group</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302721">ອັບເດດກຸ່ມ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32342_1653526_2302413"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A managed property that can be queried against. The query must contain the managed property field name, either in the query itself or programmatically.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653526">queryable managed property</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302413">ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ມີການຈັດການແບບສອບຖາມໄດ້</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32343_1653528_2302442"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A managed property that can be used as the basis for a refiner for search results.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653528">refinable managed property</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302442">ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ມີການຈັດການແບບປັບປຸງໄດ້</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32344_1653529_2302470"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A managed property that can be displayed in search results.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653529">retrievable managed property</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302470">ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ມີການຈັດການແບບເອີ້ນໃຊ້ໄດ້</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32345_1653531_2302513"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A managed property whose value can be returned by a query.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653531">searchable managed property</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302513">ຄຸນສົມບັດການຊອກຫາທີ່ມີການຈັດການ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32346_1653533_2302603"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A managed property whose result set can be sorted based on the property before the result set is returned.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1653533">sortable managed property</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302603">ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ມີການຈັດການແບບຮຽງລຳດັບໄດ້</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32350_1656127_2301771"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A user defined dictionary that lists single words or phrases that the system matches to words in the content in either a case-sensitive way or a case-insensitive way, depending on the type of dictionary that is used.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656127">custom extraction dictionary</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2301771">ວັດຈະນານຸກົມການສະກັດແບບກຳນົດເອງ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32351_1656134_2301932"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A custom extraction dictionary that lists words or phrases that are matched to exact words in the content in a case-sensitive way. For example, the system matches "anchor" to "anchor," but not to "Anchor" or "Anchorage."</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656134">exact word extraction dictionary</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2301932">ວັດຈະນານຸກົມຄັດກອງຄຳທີ່ກົງກັນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32352_1656137_2301933"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A custom extraction dictionary that lists words or phrases that are matched anywhere in the content in a case-sensitive way. For example, the system matches "anchor" and "anchorage," but not "Anchor."</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656137">exact word part extraction dictionary</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2301933">ວັດຈະນານຸກົມຄັດກອງສ່ວນຄຳທີ່ກົງກັນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32353_1656140_2302772"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A custom extraction dictionary that lists words or phrases that are matched to exact words in the content in a case-insensitive way. For example, the entry "anchor" will match "anchor" and "Anchor," but not "anchorage."</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656140">word extraction dictionary</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302772">ວັດຈະານຸກົມສະກັດຄຳສັບ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32354_1656141_2302774"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A custom extraction dictionary that lists words or phrases that are matched anywhere in the content in a case-insensitive way. For example, the entry "anchor" will match "anchor," "Anchor," and "anchorage."</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656141">word part extraction dictionary</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302774">ວັດຈະນານຸກົມຄັດກອງສ່ວນຄຳທີ່ກົງກັນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32355_1656142_2302510"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A data structure that describes crawled properties, managed properties, and the mapping between them.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656142">search schema</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302510">ຊອກຫາໂຄງສ້າງ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32356_1656144_2302050"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A logical portion of the search index.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1656144">index partition</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302050">ພາທິຊັນສາລະບານ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32359_1657886_2149579"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A set of apps that includes Messenger, Photo Gallery, Movie Maker, OneDrive, Mail, Writer, and Family Safety. (Family Safety is only included in Windows 7 downloads; it's built in to Windows 8.)</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1657886">Windows Essentials 2012</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149579">Windows Essentials 2012</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3236_80090_2114975"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The use of computers and data communication equipment to convey messages from one person to another, as by email, voice mail, or fax.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="80090">messaging</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2114975">ການສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32361_1658247_2528385"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A tool in Office 365 that enables IT professionals to manage how Office is installed for their users. Users receive the correct language and configurations individually tailored to them automatically, without the need to install anything themselves.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1658247">Office Deployment Tool</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2528385">ເຄື່ອງມືການວາງລະບົບ Office</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32362_1658249_2302740"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A mode in which SharePoint Server is the primary source for all the project details. Project Server scheduling, time and status, and advanced functionality are disabled.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1658249">visibility mode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302740">ໂໝດການແບ່ງປັນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32397_1667525_2360270"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To take action on a message by either replying to the sender, to the sender and all recipients, or by forwarding the message to someone else.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1667525">respond</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2360270">ອບກັບ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32397_1667525_2780796"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To take action on a message by either replying to the sender, to the sender and all recipients, or by forwarding the message to someone else.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1667525">respond</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2780796">ຕອບກັບ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32398_1672123_2301978"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A pane in the Outlook window that contains folders for each view, such as Mail or Calendar.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1672123">Folder Pane</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2301978">ແຖບໂຟນເດີ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="32399_1672771_2216915"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature of Windows that provide right-click access from taskbar program buttons to the documents, pictures, songs, or websites a user frequently accesses.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1672771">Jump List</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2216915">ລາຍ​ການ​ກະ​ໂດດ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><