es</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2324207">ມາໃໝ່ ແລະກຳລັງມາແຮງ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33606_1803761_2115010"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An external device that interacts with an NFC-enabled phone. These devices exchange data, such as contact details or secure payment information, with NFC-enabled phones through contactless communication.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1803761">NFC reader</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2115010">ເຄື່ອງອ່ານ NFC</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33607_1803831_2115011"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An exchange of information between two devices using NFC, or near field communication. Using NFC transactions, a person can use their phone to make payments in a store or as a bus pass.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1803831">NFC transaction</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2115011">ທຸລະ​ກໍາ NFC</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33608_1803832_2115019"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The data limit plan where users purchase upfront a quota of data for a given time. For instance, pre-paid 500MB which expire in 6 months.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1803832">One time</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2115019">ຄັ້ງດຽວ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33609_1803833_2115025"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To navigate through screens or menus at a controlled rate, performed by putting your finger(s) on and keeping contact with the phone's touch screen while moving it around.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1803833">pan</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2115025">ແພນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33611_1805602_2737922"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The button that allows users to purchase Skype Credit for their Skype account.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1805602">Buy Skype Credit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2737922">ເຄຣດິດ Skype</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33611_1805602_2737925"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The button that allows users to purchase Skype Credit for their Skype account.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1805602">Buy Skype Credit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2737925">ຊື້ Skype ເຄດິດ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33611_2713985_2737922"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The button that allows users to purchase Skype Credit for their Skype account.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2713985">Skype Credit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2737922">ເຄຣດິດ Skype</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33611_2713985_2737925"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The button that allows users to purchase Skype Credit for their Skype account.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2713985">Skype Credit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2737925">ຊື້ Skype ເຄດິດ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33612_1805603_2737921"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The credit that can be purchased, added to a Skype account, and then used to pay for Skype features and functionalities that are not free.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1805603">Skype Credit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2737921">ເຄຣດິດ Skype</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33614_1805607_2735097"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Skype feature that enables automatic payments so that the user doesn't run out of Skype Credit.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1805607">auto top-up</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2735097">ເຕີມເງິນອັດຕະໂນມັດ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNo