 name server for updated information about a domain.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1954771">name server record</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2673744">name server record</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="33959_1961341_2288615"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A series of pictures that are continuously stored in the Camera app so the user can go "back" or "forward" in time from the moment they actually pressed the button to capture a photo.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1961341">photo loop</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2288615">ຫ່ວງ​ຮູບ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3396_211830_2163628"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The value of a scorecard element in relation to the values of other elements of the same type.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="211830">weight</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2163628">ນ້ຳ​ໜັກ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</ter