 drive, for example C:\Users\jason. The user profile could be a local profile, which is stored on a single computer, or a roaming user profile, which is synchronized with a file server so that multiple PCs can use the same profile settings.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2114594">profile path</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2216922">ຊ່ອງ​ທາງ​ໂປ​ຣ​ໄຟ​ລ໌</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3732_15888_2179160"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The separator between account names and domain names in Internet email addresses.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="15888">at sign</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2179160">ເຄື່ອງໝາຍ @</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3732_15888_464887"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The separator between account names and domain names in Internet email addresses.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="15888">at sign</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="464887">ເຄື່ອງໝາຍແອັດ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Nou