s of use.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2244888">Report a violation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2381165">ລາຍງານການລະເມີດ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38627_2244890_2380943"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Sway menu that displays all of the available cards in a single panel.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2244890">Card gallery</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2380943">ຄັງບັດ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38628_2244894_2381138"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Sway button that allows users to create a hyperlink embedded in their sway.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2244894">Link</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2381138">ລິ້ງ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38629_2244901_2301874"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Outlook folder where archived items are stored.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2244901">Archive</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2301874">ແຟ້ມຈັດເກັບ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38631_2247560_2252120"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The app that assists customers in upgrading from Windows 7 Service Pack 1 (SP1) or Windows 8.1 Update 1 to Windows 10.  It notifies them of the option to upgrade, checks their PC for compatibility, and allows them to reserve a free upgrade.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2247560">Get Windows 10</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2252120">ເອົາ Windows 10</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38632_2247561_2252113"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The website where people can download Microsoft software for recovery (when they own it, but the old copy has been damaged), or first-time installation (when they own the rights, but haven't yet acquired the software itself).</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2247561">Microsoft Software Download</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2252113">ດາວ​ໂຫຼດ​ຊອບ​ແວ Microsoft</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38633_2247562_2252111"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A work area on a computer screen that contains different groups of apps or content open and available for different tasks or aspects of your life.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2247562">virtual desktop</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2252111">ເດັ​ສ​ທັອບ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38633_2247562_2252121"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A work area on a computer screen that contains different groups of apps or content open and available for different tasks or aspects of your life.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2247562">virtual desktop</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2252121">ເດັ​ສ​ທັອບ​ສະ​ເໝືອນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><