r at the present time that he/she have accepted and marked as busy.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="503135">In a meeting</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2728445">ກຳລັງປະຊຸມ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38855_2259279_2555146"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The prizes and Microsoft currency awarded when completing designated Xbox-related tasks.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259279">Xbox Live Rewards</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2555146">ລາງວັນ Xbox Live</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38860_2259500_2263636"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The first-party Windows app for playing commercial and homemade DVD-Video discs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259500">DVD Player</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2263636">ເຄື່ອງ​ຫຼິ້ນ DVD</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38860_2259500_2263649"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The first-party Windows app for playing commercial and homemade DVD-Video discs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259500">DVD Player</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2263649">Windows ເຄື່ອງ​ຫຼິ້ນ DVD</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38860_2259501_2263636"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The first-party Windows app for playing commercial and homemade DVD-Video discs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259501">Windows DVD Player</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2263636">ເຄື່ອງ​ຫຼິ້ນ DVD</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38860_2259501_2263649"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The first-party Windows app for playing commercial and homemade DVD-Video discs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259501">Windows DVD Player</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2263649">Windows ເຄື່ອງ​ຫຼິ້ນ DVD</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38866_2259535_2263651"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The variable default lock screen image that shows beautiful images on lock combined with hotspots containing fun facts, Windows tips/trick, and more. Users can switch from this default lock screen to a personal picture.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259535">Windows spotlight</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2263651">Windows ສະ​ປັອດ​ໄລ້</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38878_2259608_2263644"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A code used to remove Reset protection without having the Microsoft account credentials that were used to turn it on.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259608">recovery key</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2263644">ປຸ່ມ​ກູ້​ຄືນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38879_2259611_2436319"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To add a shortcut to an application or part of an application or contact by fixing its tile to the Start screen (the full screen view of Start) or Start menu.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259611">pin to Start</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2436319">ປັກໝຸດໃສ່ໜ້າຈໍເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3888_25223_464948"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A communication line used for data transfer among the components of a computer system.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="25223">bus</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="464948">ເສັ້ນທາງເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອຸປະກອນຄອມພິວເຕີ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38880_2259632_2263654"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In the Windows Store for Business and Education Store, to get apps and other digital goods into the hands of employees or students.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259632">distribute</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2263654">ແຈກ​ຢາຍ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38881_2259633_2263635"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A mode that allows using one app on your mobile screen while using a different app on a second screen that you're projecting from the mobile device.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259633">dual-screen mode</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2263635">ໂໝດ​ສອງ​ໜ້າ​ຈໍ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38882_2259634_2263653"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that lets customers extend their gaming experience across multiple devices, play with other users, and show off scores and achievements.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259634">game hub</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2263653">ເກມ​ຮັບ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38883_2259635_2263637"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The default browser in Windows 10, which provides a more interoperable, reliable, and discoverable experience with advanced features including the ability to annotate on web pages, a distraction-free reading experience, and integration of Cortana. Also available on iOS and Android.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259635">Microsoft Edge</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2263637">Microsoft Edge</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38884_2259636_2263642"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The source location of files that are stored on OneDrive and not synced to the local device. This is different from other OneDrive files (just called "OneDrive"), where a copy is synced and stored locally as well as in the cloud.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259636">OneDrive (cloud only)</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2263642">OneDrive (ຄ​ລາວ​ເທົ່າ​ນັ້ນ)</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38885_2259637_2263643"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A user role within Windows Store for Business that allows the user to acquire apps from Windows Store for Business on behalf of his company.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259637">purchaser</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2263643">ຜູ້​ຊື້</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38886_2259638_2263646"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A view of a set of photos that displays them one at a time, sequentially.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259638">slideshow</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2263646">ສະ​ໄລ​ດ໌​ໂຊ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38887_2259809_2263640"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The section in the Settings app for Windows 10 desktop, containing network and Internet settings.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259809">Network &amp; Internet</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2263640">ເຄືອ​ຂ່າຍ ແລະ​ອິນ​ເຕີ​ເນັດ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38888_2259810_2263641"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The section in the Settings app for Windows 10 Mobile, containing network and wireless (mobile) settings.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2259810">Network &amp; wireless</term><t