</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38983_2267305_2380959"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Sway card that takes two images and creates a swipe left/right interaction so that they can be compared.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2267305">Comparison</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2380959">ການປຽບທຽບ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38984_2267306_2381132"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Sway card that allows users to create a hierarchical document structure with a heading within a particular section of a Sway.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2267306">Heading</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2381132">ຫົວຂໍ້</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38986_2267308_2380926"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Sway button that differentiates selected content based on said content and the current Design.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2267308">Accent</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2380926">ໃຈ້ແຍກ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38994_2267490_2429552"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A connected set of episodes or events that run under the same title, usually within the course of one year.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2267490">season</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2429552">ຊີຊັນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="38995_2267556_2343878"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The default text in the sign-in page prompting the user to enter the credentials to access Microsoft cloud services.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2267556">Sign in with your work or school account</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2343878">ລົງຊື່ເຂົ້າໃຊ້ດ້ວຍບັນຊີບ່ອນເຮັດວຽກ ຫຼືໂຮງຮຽນຂອງທ່ານ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Other</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39011_2321515_2325340"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Music, a highly personalized form of auto-playlist (rules-based playlist) that is created by Microsoft for the customer, drawing music from the customer's music collection, and, if the customer has an active music pass, may also include songs from our music catalog.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2321515">mixtape</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2325340">ເພງຮວມ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39012_2268334_2270669"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Cellular data that customers can buy from the Windows Store to connect to their Windows device.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2268334">paid cellular data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2270669">ຂໍ້ມູນເຊວລູລາຈ່າຍເງິນແລ້ວ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39013_2268335_2270670"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A Wi-Fi data or cellular data network that customers can connect to by buying minutes from the Windows Store.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2268335">paid data network</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2270670">ເຄືອ​ຂ່າຍ​ຂໍ້​ມູນ​ຈ່າຍ​ເງິນ​ແລ້ວ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39015_2268349_2270673"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An area in the Music app where recently played songs/albums and service-generated mixes are aggregated.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2268349">quick play</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2270673">ຫຼິ້ນ​ດ່ວນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3902_139982_2163080"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A presentation within a presentation in which you group slides in an existing presentation so that you can show that section of the presentation to a particular audience.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="139982">custom show</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2163080">ສະ​ແດງ​ຕາມ​ກຳ​ນົດ​ເອງ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3906_30558_2162890"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A distance between characters in a line of text.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="30558">character spacing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2162890">ໄລຍະຫ່າງຕົວອັກ​ສອນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="3909_7248_2301561"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Windows-based computers, a 32-bit value (a bitmask) that specifies the permissions that are assigned in an access control entry (ACE). An access mask is also part of the access request when an object is opened. The access mask in the request is compared to the access mask in each ACE to determine whether or not to grant the request.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="7248">access mask</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2301561">ໂຕພາງການເຂົ້າເຖິງ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="39099_2270801_2290538"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The year 2016 edition of Office Home &amp; Business.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2270801">Office Home &amp; Business 2016</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2290538">Office ບ້ານ ແລະ ທຸ​ລະ​ກິດ 2016</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNot