ights such as top collaborators and contacts with whom users may be losing touch.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2429250">Microsoft MyAnalytics</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2590821">MyAnalytics</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40311_2588076_2590821"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Microsoft service that shows users how they spend their work time, including time by categories like meetings, email, focus hours, and after hours work as well as network insights such as top collaborators and contacts with whom users may be losing touch.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2588076">MyAnalytics</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2590821">MyAnalytics</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40312_2653175_2655602"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Outlook add-in that provides email statistics such as read percentages, number of forwards, and average reply time.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2653175">MyAnalytics Outlook add-in</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2655602">ແອດອິນ MyAnalytics Outlook</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40315_2345366_2357475"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Universal Windows app that allows a person to add credit cards that can be used to pay for things with their phones using NFC. The app can also be used to save loyalty cards, coupons, boarding passes, and event tickets.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2345366">Microsoft Wallet</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2357475">ກະເປົາເງິນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40315_2354807_2357475"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Universal Windows app that allows a person to add credit cards that can be used to pay for things with their phones using NFC. The app can also be used to save loyalty cards, coupons, boarding passes, and event tickets.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2354807">Wallet</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2357475">ກະເປົາເງິນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40340_2345583_2349914"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The functionality that translates the drawing speed of an object on a touch-screen device into thickness of the line on the screen--the higher the speed, the thicker the line.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2345583">Velocity Ink</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2349914">ໝຶກຄວາມໄວ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40341_2345591_2347338"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To mark a location on a map by interacting directly with the map, instead of searching for an address or place name.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2345591">drop a pin</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2347338">ວາງເຂັມປັກໝຸກ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="40342_2345592_2347341"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A location marker that users can manually add to a map, so they can see it on the map and get additional location info and directions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2345592">pin</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNo