 network protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2453429">ການປົກປ້ອງໄຟຣ໌ວໍ ແລະ ເຄືອຂ່າຍ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43297_2451805_2453430"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The area of the Windows Defender app that contains all functionalities related to antivirus and threat protection.​​</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2451805">Virus &amp; threat protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2453430">ການປົກປ້ອງໄວຣັສ ແລະ ໄພຄຸກຄາມ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43299_2451996_2454540"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The OneNote feature that allows users to set a picture as a background in their notebooks, type over it,​​ and annotate it.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2451996">Background pictures</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2454540">ຮູບພື້ນຫຼັງ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammatic