ps connection that allows apps to access user profiles in an organization, as well as the profiles of their managers and direct reports.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2453751">Office 365 Users</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2456486">ຜູ້ໃຊ້ Office 365</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4332_141858_2163155"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The name of a category of information in a mail-merge data source. For example, "City," "State," and "PostalCode" are commonly used field names in an address list.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="141858">field name</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2163155">ຊື່​ບ່ອນ​ປ້ອນ​ຂໍ້​ມູນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43324_2454174_2456506"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The button that launches a digital ruler that allows users to draw straight ink and align shapes against​ it.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2454174">Ruler</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2456506">ບັນທັດ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43325_2454194_2456508"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A tool that can positioned within content so that users can align objects and ink straight lines.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2454194">virtual ruler</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2456508">ບັນທັດສະເໝືອນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4335_503143_2149524"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Software that prevents the display of pop-up items when browsing the Internet.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="503143">pop-up blocker</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149524">ຕົວ​ບ​ລັອກ​ປັອບ​ອັບ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="43350_2455378_2485407"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A series of characters used to verify an account.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2455378">verification code</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp>