 number of deals have not been finalized (won or lost), as well as their sum.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2488795">Deals active</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2498649">ຂໍ້ສະເໜີດຳເນີນຢູ່</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44315_2489135_2498647"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The offer for students and educators that includes the Universal Windows Platform versions of Excel, PowerPoint, and Word, and that allows shared computer activation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2489135">Office 365 Education Cart</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2498647">ແຜນວາດການສຶກສາ Office 365</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="44329_2489211_2590053"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The application available on devices you manage with Intune which is used to access company data to perform common tasks like enrolling devices, installing apps, and locating information for assistance from your IT department.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2489211">Intune Company Portal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langS