e audio conferences or international phone calls.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2843752">prepaid wallet</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2849066">ກະເປົາແບບຈ່າຍລ່ວງໜ້າ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45144_2549937_2555928"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip to add an adventurous atmosphere and create a theme along with a related text style and music.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2549937">Adventure</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2555928">ຜະຈົນໄພ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45145_2549940_2555934"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip to give it a classic look. This is also the name of a theme that applies this filter along with a related text style and music. It evokes a simple, classic, and elegant look and feel.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2549940">Classic</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2555934">ດັ້ງເດີມ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45146_2549941_2555929"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip to give it a slightly whitened, lightened, or bleached effect.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2549941">Blanch</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2555929">ຟອກຂາວ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45147_2549942_2555949"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The black and white filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2549942">Portrait</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2555949">ຮູບຄົນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45148_2549943_2555943"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The black and white filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip. This filter has deeper blacks and whiter whites than other filters.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2549943">Inky</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2555943">ເມິກ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45149_2549945_2555952"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which gives it an effect of muted late evening light.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2549945">Twilight</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2555952">ຊ່ວງຕາເວັນລັບຟ້າ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45150_2549970_2555939"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which intensifies the red and orange tones in the image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2549970">Energy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2555939">ພະລັງງານ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45151_2549985_2555942"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which intensifies the blue tones in the image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2549985">Iceberg</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2555942">ພູເຂົານ້ຳແຂງ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45152_2550010_2555945"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which intensifies the green tones in the image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550010">Kelly</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2555945">ເຄລີ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45153_2550035_2555931"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which intensifies the colors.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550035">Brassy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2555931">ບຣາຊີ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45154_2550036_2555936"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which gives it a slightly rough and worn out quality.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550036">Denim</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2555936">ຍີນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45155_2550037_2555935"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which sharpens the image and keeps colors intact.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550037">Clean</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2555935">ສະອາດ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45156_2550038_2555932"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which gives it a muted, blue-green effect. This is also the name of a theme that applies this filter along with a related text style and music. It evokes a subdued, cool, relaxed look and feel.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550038">Chilled</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2555932">ເຍືອກເຢັນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45157_2550041_2555938"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which gives it a feeling of energy, and the purple light you might see before an electrical storm. This is also the name of a theme that applies this filter along with a related text style and music.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550041">Electric</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2555938">ຕື່ນເຕັ້ນມີພະລັງ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45158_2550043_2555951"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which gives it a golden brownish hue like sand.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550043">Sandy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2555951">ເຫຼື່ອມເໝືອນເມັດຊາຍ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45159_2550044_2555944"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which gives it a cheerful, playful, sunny feeling. This is also the name of a theme that applies this filter along with a related text style and music.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550044">Joy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2555944">ຄວາມສຸກ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45160_2550045_2555933"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which gives it a yellow tone.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550045">Citrus</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2555933">ສົ້ມ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45161_2550046_2555947"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which has a coarse texture and hard edges like metal.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550046">Metallic</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2555947">ໂລຫະ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45162_2550047_2555927"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which has the faded quality of photos taken in the mid-1960s.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550047">1966</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2555927">1966</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45163_2550050_2555946"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The filter that users can apply to a photo or video clip, which has a warm, sentimental feeling. This is also the name of a theme that applies this filter along with a related text style and music.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550050">Loved</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2555946">ຄວາມຮັກ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45187_2550377_2555940"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The text overlay style in Story Remix. This style is simple, classic, and fresh, with white text that animates in with a rising motion.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550377">Fresh</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2555940">ສົດຊື່ນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45188_2550381_2555948"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A text overlay style in Story Remix. This style resembles the typography of a printed book of poetry or a novel.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550381">Poetry</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2555948">ບົດກະວີ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45189_2550383_2555930"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The text overlay style in Story Remix. This style is big, bold and uses very large type.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550383">Boom</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2555930">ບູມ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45190_2550385_2555941"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The text overlay style in Story Remix. This style is big, bold, and uses a colored block with transparent lettering that resembles a stencil or poster graphic.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550385">Graphic</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2555941">ກຣາຟິກ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45191_2550387_2555950"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A text overlay style in Story Remix, with a semi-opaque white background, and subtle typography.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2550387">Quiet</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2555950">ງຽບສະຫງົບ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45192_2550388_2555937"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The text overlay style in Story Remix, with white outlined, transparent lettering that looks modern, linear, and authentic.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><