ingular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2583248">ການກວດສອບແນວໂນ້ມ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45831_2580607_2583251"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A organized effort to spread malware.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2580607">malware campaign</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2583251">ແຄມເປນມັລແວ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45832_2580609_2583252"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An organized effort to trick computer users into revealing information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2580609">phishing campaign</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2583252">ແຄມເປນຟິດຊິງ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45833_2581650_2583253"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The add-in that enables internal or external reviewers of an organization to capture employee communications for examination.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2581650">Supervision</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2583253">ການເບິ່ງແຍງກວດກາ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45834_2581651_2583254"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The dashboard that provides a summary of threats that were detected in an organization, top targeted users, security trends, etc.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2581651">Threat Dashboard</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2583254">ແຜງໜ້າປັດໄພຄຸກຄາມ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="45835_2581653_2583250"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that enables tracking of phishing or malware campaigns aimed at an organization's users and triggering remediation actions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2581653">Incidents</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2583250">ເຫດການ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSe