anges, that occur in one second.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1176942">line speed</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="464920">ອັດຕາຄວາມໄວໂມເດັມ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="4660_20603_464920"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The speed at which a modem can transmit data, measured by the number of events, or signal changes, that occur in one second.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="20603">baud rate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="464920">ອັດຕາຄວາມໄວໂມເດັມ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="46600_2621935_2622767"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A test that reveals flaws in the security mechanisms of a computer systems, showing if they protect data and maintain functionality as intended.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2621935">security test</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2622767">ທົດສອບຄວາມປອດໄພ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type