 and graphics, such as a standard contract clause, that can be used multiple times in one or more documents. Each selection of text or graphics is recorded as an AutoText entry and assigned a unique name. It is visible in Quick Parts and the Building Blocks Organizer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="234579">AutoText</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2162902">ຂໍ້​ຄວາມອັດຕະໂນມັດ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49180_2785672_2789430"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Data Investigations tab where admins can add and manage the people that they identified as persons of interest during an investigation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2785672">People of interest</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2789430">ຄົນທີ່ໜ້າສົນໃຈ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="49182_2785684_2789431"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Data Investigations tab where admins can create searches to find the Office 365 for data that they want to remediate.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2785684">Searches</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></