 helps members get their products working and integrated with Windows by providing Windows APIs and other technologies including IOAV, AMSI and Cloud files.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2842111">Microsoft Virus Initiative</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2848125">MVI</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50248_2842112_2848124"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A membership program that helps members get their products working and integrated with Windows by providing Windows APIs and other technologies including IOAV, AMSI and Cloud files.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2842112">MVI</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2848124">Microsoft Virus Initiative</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50248_2842112_2848125"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A membership program that helps members get their products working and integrated with Windows by providing Windows APIs and other technologies including IOAV, AMSI and Cloud files.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2842112">MVI</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></l