ons, themes, and other add-ons for Microsoft Edge.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2856044">Microsoft Edge add-ons</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2860713">ສ່ວນເສີມ Microsoft Edge</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50521_2860780_3020360"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows Shadow Stack security feature that prevents a class of vulnerabilities known as Return-Oriented Programming (ROP) and requires hardware in order to work.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2860780">hardware-enforced stack protection</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3020360">HSP</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="50521_3019770_3020360"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The Windows Shadow Stack security feature that prevents a class of vulnerabilities known as Return-Oriented Programming (ROP) and requires hardware in order to work.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3019770">HSP</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3020360">HSP</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNo