replace traditional PBXs, and enables key calling capabilities.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2947840">Teams Phone</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2949379">ໂທລະສັບຂອງ Teams</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52043_2930012_2930333"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that appears in the Excel home tab, powered by AI, that helps people analyze their data by providing summaries, visual and significant trends and insights, and allows Natural Language Queries about the data.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2930012">Analyze Data</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2930333">ວິເຄາະຂໍ້ມູນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52044_2930013_2930334"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The service of expert assistance that helps very small businesses get the most out of their Microsoft 365 subscription, including migration help, end-user support, and personalized advice from small business specialists.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2930013">Business Assist for Microsoft 365</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langS