950117_2950516"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The SharePoint feature that delivers a faster and more fluid page navigation experience, in pages and site templates that support it, by downloading and rendering only those portions of a page that are changing.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2950117">Minimal Download Strategy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2950516">ແຜນດາວໂຫຼດໜ້ອຍສຸດ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52170_2950118_2950515"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The SharePoint feature that provides each list in the site with a settings pages for configuring that list to use metadata tree view hierarchies and filter controls to improve navigation and filtering of the contained items.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2950118">Metadata Navigation and Filtering</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2950515">ການນໍາທາງ ແລະ ກັນຕ່ອງເມຕາດາຕາ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="52171_2950119_2950518"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The SharePoint feature that allows the user to limit navigation to show them only links that they have access to.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="2