r Samsung phone about a problem with their ARDK head-mounted display.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3033423">ARDK Feedback</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3033636">ຄໍາຕິຊົມ ARDK</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Mass</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53247_3033521_3034162"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The UK bank holiday celebrated on June 3, 2022 to commemorate the 70th anniversary of Queen Elizabeth II's accession to the throne.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3033521">Platinum Jubilee Bank Holiday</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3034162">ມື້ພັກສະຫຼອງວັນຄອງລາດຄົບຮອບເຈັດສິບປີ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5325_145206_2162544"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To minimize the duplication of information in a relational database through effective table design.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="145206">normalize</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2162544">ເຮັດ​ເປັນ​ທຳ​ມະ​ດາ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="g