st for the customer.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3056784">Customer Advocacy Group</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3057028">ກຸ່ມສະໜັບສູນລູກຄ້າດ້ານສະເພາະ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53689_3056785_3057025"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A badge displayed on a profile image to identify a champion.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3056785">champion badge</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3057025">ປ້າຍແຊັມປ້ຽນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5369_34870_2162883"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A special symbol that breaks a column when inserted into a document. It ends the current column and starts the next column.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="34870">column break</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2162883">ແຍກ​ຖັນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53690_3056787_3060842"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In programming, pertaining to a development method that uses a drag-and-drop approach and doesn’t require any coding knowledge.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3056787">no-code</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3060842">ບໍ່ມີລະຫັດ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53691_3056788_3060841"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In programming, pertaining to a development method that uses a drag-and-drop approach and requires basic knowledge of coding to finish the building and deploying process.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3056788">low-code</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3060841">ລະຫັດຕໍ່າ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53692_3056798_3057375"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In gaming, a method by which games just read and write from their desired save directory, using the standard Win32 file IO APIs, and synchronization is handled automatically.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3056798">cloud save</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3057375">ບັນທຶກຄລາວ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53693_3056864_3057024"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The feature that launches the ink editing experience in Word, allowing the users to edit documents with ink gestures.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3056864">Action Pen</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3057024">ປາກກາສໍາລັບການດໍາເນີນການ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53694_3056893_3057032"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An operational setup designed to meet both the physical and technological needs of a business and its workers.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3056893">modern workplace</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3057032">ບ່ອນເຮັດວຽກທັນສະໄໝ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="53695_3056894_3057030"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><des