 type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55030_3119267_3119310"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The act of attesting data sets within OneLake as being trusted and authoritative.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3119267">data certification</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3119310">ການຢັ້ງຢືນຂໍ້ມູນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55031_3119353_3119738"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A form of storage volume that improves performance for developer workloads.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3119353">dev drive</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3119738">ຊ່ອງນັກພັດທະນາ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55032_3119357_3119402"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The costs associated with organizations having to integrate different analytics products and services together to develop a full solution.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3119357">integration tax</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3119402">ການຮວມອາກອນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55033_3119445_3119488"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A type of storage architecture that uses a data lake to hold all relevant data for an organization, rather than a data warehouse or other relational database.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3119445">lake-first</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3119488">ທະເລສາບກ່ອນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55034_3119531_3119874"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A capability that enables administrators to secure specific tables or columns from specific report viewers who do not have appropriate access levels.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3119531">object-level security</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3119874">ຄວາມປອດໄພລະດັບວັດຖຸ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55035_3119825_3119960"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The practice of structuring information models and associated data schemas such that every data element is mastered (or edited) in only one place.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3119825">single source of truth</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3119960">ແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນແທ້ຈິງບ່ອນດຽວ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55036_3119828_3120045"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The enterprise-grade data lake as a service provided within each tenant of Microsoft Fabric.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3119828">OneLake</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3120045">OneLake</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55037_3119830_3120130"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Microsoft Fabric, the virtualized copy of data in the lake that all analytical engines can access.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3119830">One Copy</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3120130">ສໍາເນົາດຽວ</term><termNote ty