ure that allows users to migrate chats and meetings between tenants so that they can access their chat history and continue to use the same threads and meetings after migrating.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3125068">Cross-tenant Teams Migration​</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3125293">ການຍ້າຍ Teams ລະຫວ່າງຜູ້ເຊົ່າ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55118_3125069_3125908"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Microsoft's multi-tenant cloud-based directory and identity management service that combines core directory services, application access management, and identity protection into a single solution.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3125069">Microsoft Entra ID</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3125908">Microsoft Entra ID</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">ProperNoun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="55134_3126369_3126731"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The acknowledgment of a contributor's services, typically a list of names, that is displayed at the end of a video.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3126369">credit</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGr