 within the inline editing canvas of Designer in Copilot where you can select an object and AI highlights the color to make the object pop and then mutes the color of the rest of the image.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161604">color pop</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3162858">ສີປ໋ອບ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56225_3161605_3162861"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A style option that is part of the inline editing experience within Copilot. Pixel art images are built using pixels as the only building blocks.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161605">pixel art</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3162861">ສິລະປະພິກເຊວ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56226_3161606_3162864"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A style option that makes an image or photograph look like a watercolor painting.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161606">watercolor</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3162864">ສີນໍ້າ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56227_3161607_3162856"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A style option that is part of the inline editing experience within Copilot. Block print technique involves carving a design into wood or linoleum and using that block to print the design onto paper or fabric.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161607">block print</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3162856">ແມ່ພິມບລັອກ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56228_3161608_3162863"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A style option that is part of the inline editing experience within Copilot. Steampunk images often combine elements of the Victorian era with futuristic technology, including gears, cogs, brass, and steam-powered machinery.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161608">steampunk</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3162863">ສະຕີມພັງຄ໌</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56229_3161609_3162857"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A style option that is part of the inline editing experience within Copilot. Claymation images use movable clay characters and are often seen in children's films and cartoons.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161609">claymation</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3162857">ອະນິເມຊັນດິນໜຽວ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56230_3161610_3162855"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A style option that is part of the inline editing experience within Copilot. Art deco images often blends modernity and luxury, creating a glamorous style.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161610">art deco</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3162855">ສິລະປະຕົບແຕ່ງ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56231_3161611_3162859"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A style option that is part of the inline editing experience within Copilot. Low poly images use a limited number of polygons to represent shapes and are characterized by their simplicity and geometric shapes.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161611">low poly</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3162859">ໂພລີຕໍ່າ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56232_3161612_3162860"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A style option that is part of the inline editing experience within Copilot. Origami style is characterized by its minimalism, geometric shapes and creativity.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161612">origami</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3162860">ໂອຣິກາມິ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56233_3161613_3162862"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that allows users to take 1-2 images/photos and select a style or type a prompt and have your images combined and reimagined, generating an image with a new style.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161613">restyle image</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3162862">ປັບຮູບແບບຮູບພາບຄືນໃໝ່</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5624_1517462_2737932"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A window that is displayed when users are participating in a virtual conversation and that displays a list of participants, the conversation content, and the commands and controls for managing the conversation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="1517462">instant messaging window</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2737932">ການສົນທະນາ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="5624_418623_2737932"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A window that is displayed when users are participating in a virtual conversation and that displays a list of participants, the conversation content, and the commands and controls for managing the conversation.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="418623">conversation window</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2737932">ການສົນທະນາ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56242_3161706_3165893"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An AI-powered feature that determines and selects the optimized view of each person in a meeting room by comparing multiple video sources, such as laptop and room cameras, and selecting the best video view.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3161706">automatic camera switching​</term><termNote type="part