at makes an image or photograph look like color block art, which uses bold and bright blocks of color to create striking compositions.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3173982">colorblock</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3174313">ບລັອກສີ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56464_3173993_3174323"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A style option available in Designer that makes an image or photograph look like a flat illustration, with clean lines, bold color palettes, and absence of gradients, shadows, or textures.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3173993">flat illustration</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3174323">ພາບຮຽບງ່າຍ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56466_3173995_3174318"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A style option available in Designer that makes an image or photograph look like a whimsical doodle expressed through wandering lines and shapes, exuding spontaneity and intricacy.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3173995">doodle art</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3174318">ສິລະປະເສັ້ນແຕ້ມ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56467_3173996_3174324"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A style option available in Designer that makes an image or photograph look like folk art with a modern twist, combining hints of cultural traditions, heritages, and beliefs, with vibrant colors, patterns, and motifs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3173996">modern folk art</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3174324">ສິລະປະພື້ນເມືອງແບບທັນສະໄໝ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56469_3174000_3174315"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A style option available in Designer that takes a photograph or image and creates an alternate form of reality, often depicting the subject from multiple points of view simultaneously, resulting in a fractured and compartmentalized aesthetic.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3174000">cubism</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3174315">ສິລະປະແບບກ້ອນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56470_3174014_3174312"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that uses AI to create a video based on a user’s prompt or inputs.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3174014">auto compose</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3174312">ການແຕ່ງອັດຕະໂນມັດ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56471_3174015_3174322"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A feature that removes filler words such as ums and ahs from media.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3174015">filler word removal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3174322">ການລຶບຄໍາເຕີມ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56484_3175461_3176149"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A series of surveys.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3175461">pulse program</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3176149">ໂຄງການພັລສ໌</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56484_3175461_3176151"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A series of surveys.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3175461">pulse program</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3176151">ໂຄງການສໍາຫຼວດ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56484_3175466_3176149"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A series of surveys.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3175466">survey program</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3176149">ໂຄງການພັລສ໌</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56484_3175466_3176151"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A series of surveys.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3175466">survey program</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3176151">ໂຄງການສໍາຫຼວດ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56485_3175462_3176144"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A single survey within a program.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3175462">cycle</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3176144">ຮອບ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56486_3175464_3176145"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A survey which is linked to all other surveys within a program, meaning that any changes made at the program level will automatically apply to all future surveys in the program.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3175464">linked survey</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="3176145">ການສໍາຫຼວດທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງແລ້ວ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="56487_3175465_3176152"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A survey which is not linked to other surveys within a program, meaning that any edits made only affect that survey and not future surveys in the same program.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="3175465">unlinked survey</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet x