rip type="definition">An electronic publication distributed primarily through the World Wide Web, rather than as an ink-on-paper magazine.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="878">webzine</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2599899">ວາລະສານອີເລັກໂທຣນິກ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="800_878_2599902"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An electronic publication distributed primarily through the World Wide Web, rather than as an ink-on-paper magazine.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="878">webzine</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2599902">ວາລະສານ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="800_879_2599899"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An electronic publication distributed primarily through the World Wide Web, rather than as an ink-on-paper magazine.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="879">web magazine</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2599899">ວາລະສານອີເລັກໂທຣນິກ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="800_879_2599902"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">An electronic publication distributed primarily through the World Wide Web, rather than as an ink-on-paper magazine.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="879">web magazine</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2599902">ວາລະສານ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8026_149177_2302668"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Any characteristic of text, such as font, size, style, color, or effect such as subscript or superscript.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="149177">text attributes</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302668">ຄຸນສົມບັດຂໍ້ຄວາມ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Plural</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="803_44794_2179271"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The work area on a computer screen that simulates the top of an actual desk. The desktop contains the Recycle Bin and other icons (shortcuts to programs, files, folders, and various types of documents such as letters, reports, or pictures) that you can arrange on the electronic desktop just as you would arrange real objects on top of a desk.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="44794">desktop</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2179271">ເດັສທັອບ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="803_44794_465108"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The work area on a computer screen that simulates the top of an actual desk. The desktop contains the Recycle Bin and other icons (shortcuts to programs, files, folders, and various types of documents such as letters, reports, or pictures) that you can arrange on the electronic desktop just as you would arrange real objects on top of a desk.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="44794">desktop</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="465108">ພື້ນທີ່ໜ້າຈໍ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8030_37385_2163049"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">To join sequentially (for example, to combine the two strings "hello" and "there" into the single string "hello there").</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="37385">concatenate</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2163049">ຕໍ່​ກັນ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Verb</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8033_269320_2149441"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">Pertaining to methods employed to protect users from phishing.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="269320">anti-phishing</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2149441">ແອັນ​ຕິ​ພິ​ຊ​ຊິງ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8036_116444_465576"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A horizontal window at the bottom of a parent window in which an application can display various kinds of status information. The status bar can be divided into parts to display more than one type of information.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="116444">status bar</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="465576">ແຖບສະຖານະ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8040_149410_465817"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A query that uses the UNION operator to combine the results of two or more select queries.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="149410">union query</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="465817">ສະຫະພັນຄຳສັ່ງ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8051_109321_2302387"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Windows-based computers, an account (such as a user, security group, device, or computer) that can be granted or denied access to resources.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="109321">security principal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302387">ບັນຊີຜູ້ໃຊ້ຫຼັກ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8051_109321_2302522"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">In Windows-based computers, an account (such as a user, security group, device, or computer) that can be granted or denied access to resources.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="109321">security principal</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="2302522">ຊື່ຫຼັກຄວາມປອດໄພ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></nti