us that indicates a client is not connected to a server.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="87023">offline</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="465420">ບໍ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Adjective</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8871_73980_465328"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">The { character.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="73980">left brace</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="465328">ເຄື່ອງໝາຍວົງປິກກາເປີດ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8876_30983_465007"><langSet xml:lang="en-US"><descripGrp><descrip type="definition">A small x or other sign that appears in the check box if the option represented by the box is selected.</descrip></descripGrp><ntig><termGrp><term id="30983">check mark</term><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">Singular</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet><langSet xml:lang="lo"><ntig><termGrp><term id="465007">ເຄື່ອງໝາຍກວດກາ</term><termNote type="geographicalUsage">LAO</termNote><termNote type="partOfSpeech">Noun</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalGender">NotSelected</termNote><termNote type="grammaticalNumber">NotSelected</termNote></termGrp></ntig></langSet></termEntry><termEntry id="8882_187096_2301680"><langSet x